    "detailed_description": "Holy Ocean is an open sailing FPS where you ride a bike exploring the Ocean of Meat. <br><br>Explore the ocean, find bosses, defeat them, get reward, visit upgrade shop,<br><br>The world has both handmade and procedural elements and it's fully destructible.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Ask Rose how could you please her;<br></li><li> Drive your navel-cord bike on dynamic ocean waves;<br></li><li> Fight raiders and sea creatures on the go;<br></li><li> Explore secrets of human-parts-like islands drifting around;<br></li><li> Find shooters claimed the best ones and move them away;</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Holy Ocean is an open sailing FPS where you ride a bike exploring the Ocean of Meat. <br><br>Explore the ocean, find bosses, defeat them, get reward, visit upgrade shop,<br><br>The world has both handmade and procedural elements and it's fully destructible.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Ask Rose how could you please her;<br></li><li> Drive your navel-cord bike on dynamic ocean waves;<br></li><li> Fight raiders and sea creatures on the go;<br></li><li> Explore secrets of human-parts-like islands drifting around;<br></li><li> Find shooters claimed the best ones and move them away;</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Ride your bike through the ocean of meat, alone or with friends. Raiders on your tail. They built a tower on that head island. Sneak in. Take down their leader. Destroy the whole island if needed. It is all for the love of Rose",
